Welcome to ASNAT (Air Sensor Network Analysis Tool) -
a free multi-platform software application that air-quality reasearchers use for
retrieval, mapping, summarizing, comparing, plotting and saving
subsets of ground-based air sensor data read from webservices and local files.

Project start: October 2022
Contact: asnat@epa.gov

Download the ASNAT User Manual from:
https://ofmpub.epa.gov/rsig/rsigserver?asnat/download/ASNAT_User_Manual.pdf

Follow its step-by-step instructions for running ASNAT from a web browser or
downloading and installing it to run locally on your computer and several demos
showcasing ASNAT features and other related information.

The dev directory contains information for ASNAT developers.

